EVALUATION-ONLY LICENCE

This repository contains the author's MSc thesis work (Master's in Artificial
Intelligence and Big Data): a comparative study of intent-classification models
and the deployment of the selected model to a serverless runtime.

It is published for one purpose only: so that prospective employers,
collaborators and reviewers can evaluate the author's engineering and research
work.

You MAY:
  - read this material;
  - quote short excerpts when discussing or assessing the author's work.

You MAY NOT, without prior written permission from the author:
  - copy, reproduce or redistribute this material, in whole or in part;
  - modify it or create derivative works from it;
  - incorporate it into any project, product or service, commercial or not;
  - use the code, the dataset generator or the trained model to train other
    machine learning models.

The trained model in `deployment/` was fitted on synthetically generated data
and is provided for inspection only. It carries no warranty of any kind and is
not fit for clinical, medical or safety-critical use.
